silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_03_bridge_to_14_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor_3_question_set_at_N#typedenglishquestionsetatn silm:hasLongDescription "The TypedEnglishQuestionSetAtN is the typed-English questions answerable at N. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'question_set_at_N', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
